  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 26 * 52 * 38 * 57 * 23 * 53\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1): ÷ × = − +\n\n26 * 52 * 38 * 57 * 23 * 53 ⇒ 26 ÷ 52 × 38 = 57 - 23 + 53\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷**____** 52**__ × 38 = __**57 + 53**__ - 23\n\n⇒ __**0.5**____** ×**____** 38**__ = __**110 - 23**__\n\n⇒ 19 ≠ 87 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): ÷ × + − =\n\n26 * 52 * 38 * 57 * 23 * 53 ⇒ 26 ÷ 52 × 38 + 57 - 23 = 53\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷**____** 52**__ × 38 + 57 - 23 = 53\n\n⇒ __**0.5**____** ×**____** 38**__ + 57 - 23 = 53\n\n⇒ **__19__**__** + 57**__ - 23 = 53\n\n⇒ **__76__**__** - 23**__ = 53\n\n**⇒ 53 = 53 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3): ÷ = ×− + \n\n26 * 52 * 38 * 57 * 23 * 53 ⇒ 26 ÷ 52 = 38 × 57 - 23 + 53\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷**____** 52**__ = __**38 **____**×**____** 57**__ - 23 + 53\n\n⇒ 0.5 = __**2166 + 53**__ - 23\n\n⇒ 0.5 = __2219____** - 23**__\n\n⇒ 0.5 ≠ 2196 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): ÷ ×− + = \n\n26 * 52 * 38 * 57 * 23 * 53 ⇒ 26 ÷ 52 × 38 - 57 + 23 = 53\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷**____** 52**__ × 38 - 57 + 23 = 53\n\n⇒ __**0.5**____** ×**____** 38**__ - 57 + 23 = 53\n\n⇒ __**19 + 23**__ - 57 = 53\n\n⇒ __42____** - 57**__ = 53\n\n⇒ -15 ≠ 53 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
